<title>Why Is the Sky Blue? | 天空为什么是蓝色的？</title>
<style>
  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Noto Sans SC", sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f4fd 0%, #f0f8ff 50%, #e0f0ff 100%);
    min-height: 100vh;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #4a90d9 0%, #6ab0f3 100%);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 0 0 2rem 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(74, 144, 217, 0.3);
  }

  header h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  header p {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 4rem;
  }

  .section {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    border: 1px solid #e3eef9;
  }

  .section-header {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f0f7ff, #f8fbff);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #d0e8ff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-header .icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
